item.description:
Authentication endpoints. POST /auth/login is public. POST /auth/logout and GET /auth/me require a valid Bearer token.

**Login response structure:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "data": {
    "user": { ... },
    "token": "<jwt_string>"
  }
}
```
The test script on Login extracts `data.token` and stores it in the `token` collection variable.

